sequenceDiagram
    actor V as Visitor
    participant W as Widget
    participant API as POST /api/widget/escalate
    participant DB as Postgres
    actor Human as Support Team

    V->>W: Clicks "Talk to a human"
    W->>API: escalate(widget_id, session_id, conversation_id)
    API->>DB: WidgetSession.escalated = true
    API->>DB: Conversation.extra.escalated = true
    API->>DB: log WidgetEventType.escalation
    API-->>W: 200 acknowledged
    Note over DB,Human: Dashboard/inbox polls for escalated=true conversations
    Human->>DB: picks up escalated conversation
    Human-->>V: continues conversation as a human agent
